{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_01",
      "hash": "58016e7dc394c40f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「太好了……！\\c\\n來到這裡的人是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n真是太好了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_02",
      "hash": "58016f7dc394c5c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我戰勝了四天王，\\n成了寶可夢聯盟的冠軍喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_07",
      "hash": "58016c7dc394c0a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳聽大木博士說了吧？\\n成為冠軍的人\\r\\n今後要在寶可夢聯盟\\r\\n與更多的訓練家對戰！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_03",
      "hash": "5801707dc394c775",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "成為冠軍後的第一個對手\\n是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，真是太好了……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_08",
      "hash": "5801757dc394cff4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "因為[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳正是我最想要\\n拿出自己所有實力\\r\\n去戰勝的訓練家啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_04",
      "hash": "5801697dc394bb90",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n賭上冠軍的寶座，我們一決勝負吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_05",
      "hash": "58016a7dc394bd43",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「我等[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好久了，冠軍！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8200_rival_06",
      "hash": "58016b7dc394bef6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "為了能戰勝[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n我每天都在鍛鍊自己！\\c\\n今天我可不會再輸了！\\n接招吧！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_cave_d1405",
      "hash": "671813dd36f0a3d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    }
  ],
